{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ccdd2f3d-b082-451f-8e0b-837b1f08659c",
    "name": "Pipefire email deliverability tools",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Sixteen free, read-only email deliverability tools from Pipefire (https://pipefire.ai): SPF, DKIM, DMARC, MX, BIMI and MTA-STS checks, blacklist lookup, email header analysis, cold email and subject line scoring, and SPF, DMARC and DKIM record generators.\n\nNo account and no API key. Every request is a JSON-RPC call to the public MCP endpoint https://pipefire.ai/mcp, so the same tools also work in Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor and other MCP clients (https://pipefire.ai/mcp-server), and in a terminal with `npx pipefire`.\n\nRate limited per IP. Nothing you check is stored.\n\nPipefire is done-for-you cold email for agencies: https://pipefire.ai"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://pipefire.ai/mcp"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "List all tools",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"tools/list\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Returns every tool with its input schema."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
